# Answer 15 · Colonial and Capitalistic Perspectives, and Development as the New Coloniality (CSS 2024)
@py question 2024-3

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Part one is a compact note on both perspectives; part two explains coloniality, applies the thesis to gender and development with evidence, weighs the counter-argument and reaches a verdict.
@ask ① WRITE A NOTE on the COLONIAL and CAPITALISTIC PERSPECTIVES of gender
@ask ② THROW LIGHT on the thesis that DEVELOPMENT is the NEW NAME of COLONIALITY
